    body=f'''<section class="section article"><div class="eyebrow">ON A TRIP TRAVEL GUIDE</div><h1>{topic}</h1><p class="lead">{desc}</p><p>This original guide is designed to answer the questions travellers usually ask before booking: how long to stay, what to expect, how to budget and how to build a comfortable route. Exact conditions, prices and operational arrangements can change by season, so confirm current details before travel.</p><h2>How to plan the trip</h2><p>Start with your travel dates and departure city, then decide whether you want a group departure or a private/customised holiday. Compare the total journey time, hotel location, meal plan, sightseeing and daily travel rather than choosing a package on price alone.</p><h2>What to check before booking</h2><ul><li>Pickup and drop location</li><li>Hotel category and room sharing</li><li>Daily travel distance and approximate drive time</li><li>Meals included and dietary preferences</li><li>Entry tickets, permits and activity charges</li><li>Weather and route conditions for your dates</li><li>Cancellation and payment terms</li></ul><h2>Make your itinerary comfortable</h2><p>A good holiday leaves enough time for rest, sightseeing and unexpected delays. Avoid packing too many attractions into one day. For mountain and pilgrimage routes, allow additional buffer time because road conditions and weather can affect schedules.</p><div class="cta-card"><h3>Want a personalised itinerary?</h3><p>Tell us your dates, traveller count, departure city and approximate budget. Our team can suggest a practical route.</p><a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/919182894146?text=Hi%20On%20A%20Trip%20Holidays%2C%20I%20want%20a%20custom%20itinerary">Plan My Trip on WhatsApp</a></div></section>'''
